      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Poké Ball un po’ diversa che diventa\nprogressivamente più efficace con il passare\ndei turni nella lotta.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A somewhat different Poké Ball that becomes\nprogressively more effective at catching Pokémon\nthe more turns that are taken in battle.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ターン数が　かかれば　かかるほど\nポケモンが　捕まえやすくなる\nちょっと　変わった　ボール。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "有点与众不同的球。\n回合数花费得越多，\n宝可梦就会越容易捕捉。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una Poké Ball algo distinta que va mejorando su\nrendimiento con cada turno de combate.",
